      "content": "it just doesnt feel like something i can \"move past\" though. like no matter how much i try to fix it or feel better, it's just who i am now. i look at people and i just feel like such a mistake. like the world would just be better, cleaner, if i wasnt in it. it feels so logical when i think about it.",
